# Normalise line endings in the repo regardless of the OS a commit came from.
# The README is rewritten daily by a bot and occasionally by hand, so a stray
# CRLF would otherwise show up as a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.md   text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.svg  text

# Never line-ending-mangle the binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
